OL,4,CSnow this week in the UK?            W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe UK is in the grip of the coldest W5
OL,7,Gspell of autumn so far, but will it  W5
OL,8,Gresult in snow?                      W5
OL,9,                                      W5
OL,10,GMild Atlantic air that arrived in    W5
OL,11,Gthe south-west of the UK over the    W5
OL,12,Gweekend is pushing eastwards, coming W5
OL,13,Gup against colder Arctic air.        W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,GIn this setup, the meteorological    W5
OL,16,Gingredients for snow are in place;   W5
OL,17,Ghowever, there remains uncertainty   W5
OL,18,Gin where the boundary between the    W5
OL,19,Gcold and mild air will sit.          W5
